<title>USA: Control Data chosen for Motorola alliance.</title>
<headline>Control Data chosen for Motorola alliance.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Data Systems Inc said Tuesday it was selected to participate in Motorola Inc's Software Technology Supplier Alliance Program.</p>
<p>Control Data, based in Arden Hills, Minn., said it made the announcement in conjunction with a conference here this week.  </p>
<p>Under this program, all Control Data products and services qualify for participation in the Motorola supplier program.</p>
<p>Control Data said it currently provides messaging, directory and product information management software and services for Motorola worldwide.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
